module l022_facade

/* Facade module: re-exports the type + its methods by importing both the core
   (Widget + base) and the extension (doubled). A consumer that imports ONLY
   this facade must transitively see BOTH base() and doubled() on Widget.
   Note core is reachable two ways here: directly, and again via ext -> core.
   Propagation must be idempotent (no duplicate-method error on base()). */
import l022_core
import l022_ext
